    skos:broader cs2023:KU_OS_SEP ;
    skos:definition "End-of-life issues with sunsetting operating systems. Example concept: Privacy implications of using proprietary operating systems/operating environments, including telemetry, automated scanning of personal data, built-in advertising, and automatic cloud integration."@en ;
    cs2023:hasCoreStatus cs2023:KACore .

